# DO NOT copy this file to `.env` unless you know what you're doing.
#
# Vite loads `.env` for BOTH `dev` and `build`, so any absolute URL here gets
# baked into the production bundle and breaks the SPA whenever it's reached
# from a different origin (tunnel, LAN, reverse proxy).
#
# Production default: leave VITE_API_BASE_URL unset. The SPA falls back to
# `window.location.origin` at runtime — the correct answer in every layout
# where FastAPI serves the SPA itself.
#
# Dev-only override — split origins (Vite :5173 + FastAPI :7420):
#   Copy this file to `.env.local` (gitignored, loaded only when present)
#   and start the dashboard with `ORCH_DASHBOARD_DEV_CORS=1`.
#
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:7420

# Board URL is no longer configured here — it lives in the project's config.yaml
# under `dashboard.board_url`. See docs / `orch init` for details.
